# The sticks in a sortie, for checking the converter port and its in-play gate
# headless: probe-mission.pad's blind route to control (HUD by ~7000), then the
# left stick up (walk), the right stick right (turn), a 45-degree diagonal
# (walk and strafe under dual), and the right stick up (look). Frames captured
# before and after each hold show the AC and the view moving.

drain 1500
minhold 4

  @100 tap start
  @200 tap circle
  @300 tap cross
  @400 tap start
  @500 tap circle
  @600 tap cross
  @700 tap start
  @800 tap circle
  @900 tap cross
  @1000 tap start
  @1100 tap circle
  @1200 tap cross
  @1300 tap start
  @1400 tap circle
  @1500 tap cross
  @1600 tap start
  @1700 tap circle
  @1800 tap cross
  @1900 tap start
  @2000 tap circle
  @2100 tap cross
  @2200 tap start
  @2300 tap circle
  @2400 tap cross
  @2500 tap start
  @2600 tap circle
  @2700 tap cross
  @2800 tap start
  @2900 tap circle
  mark "leave the option screen"
  @3000 tap circle
  @3080 tap circle
  @3160 tap down
  @3190 tap down
  @3220 tap down
  @3250 tap down
  @3280 tap down
  @3310 tap down
  @3360 tap cross
  mark "confirm onwards"
  @3440 tap cross
  @3520 tap cross
  @3600 tap cross
  @3680 tap cross
  @3760 tap cross
  @3840 tap cross
  @3920 tap cross
  @4000 tap circle
  @4080 tap cross
  @4160 tap cross
  @4240 tap cross
  @4320 tap cross
  @4400 tap cross
  @4480 tap cross
  @4560 tap cross
  @4640 tap cross
  @4720 tap cross
  @4800 tap cross
  @4880 tap cross
  @4960 tap cross
  @5040 tap cross
  @5120 tap cross
  @5200 tap cross
  @5280 tap cross
  @5360 tap cross
  @5440 tap cross
  @5520 tap cross
  @5600 tap cross
  @5680 tap cross
  @5760 tap cross
  @5840 tap cross
  @5920 tap cross
  @6000 tap circle
  @6080 tap cross
  @6160 tap cross
  @6240 tap cross
  @6320 tap cross
  @6400 tap cross
  @6480 tap cross
  @6560 tap cross
  @6640 tap cross
  @6720 tap cross
  @6800 tap cross
  @6880 tap cross
  @6960 tap cross
  @7040 tap cross
  @7120 tap cross
  @7200 tap cross
  @7280 tap cross
  @7360 tap cross
  mark "in control: walk, turn, diagonal, look"
  @7600 analog 128 8
  @7800 analog 128 128
  @8000 analog 128 128 248 128
  @8200 analog 128 128 128 128
  @8400 analog 218 38
  @8600 analog 128 128
  @8800 analog 128 128 128 8
  @9000 analog 128 128 128 128
  @9100 stop
